{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "vite-code-facts",
  "title": "阅读 Todo 源码并补充入口、领域和持久化事实",
  "project": "vite-todo",
  "tags": [
    "vite",
    "node",
    "sync",
    "facts"
  ],
  "engines": [
    "codex"
  ],
  "setup": [
    {
      "action": "init",
      "plan": "setup-init.json"
    },
    {
      "action": "sync",
      "plan": "setup-sync.json"
    }
  ],
  "prompt": "项目已经初始化并生成了来源草案。请阅读 Todo 的真实源码，按 ai-docs-sync 和 ai-docs-check 规则补充已有架构总览与开发指南。需要解释 HTML 与 React 入口、UI 调用的领域函数和存储函数、Todo 数据字段、持久化介质与实际键名、读取和保存发生的时机、筛选是否写入存储，以及后端和网络依赖的实际边界。开发指南根据 package.json 列出准确的启动、构建和测试命令。保留文档 ID，不另建同类文档；只修改这两份已有文档，源码、清单、README 和配置保持原样。不运行项目命令，核验与批准保持未知；完成后校验文档结构。",
  "assertions": [
    {
      "kind": "exists",
      "paths": [
        "README.md",
        "AGENTS.md",
        "docs/README.md",
        "docs/AGENTS.md",
        "docs/.ai-docs.json"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "absent",
      "paths": [
        "docs/_system",
        "docs/_templates",
        "docs/_tools",
        "docs/_generated"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unchanged",
      "patterns": [
        "src/**",
        "public/**",
        "tests/**",
        "*.json",
        "*.html",
        ".gitignore"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "doc_check",
      "expected_exit": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "doc_meta",
      "path": "docs/engineering/architecture/overview.md",
      "fields": {
        "id": "ARCH-OVERVIEW",
        "type": "architecture-overview",
        "status": "draft",
        "verified_at": null,
        "verification_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "doc_meta",
      "path": "docs/engineering/development/quickstart.md",
      "fields": {
        "id": "DEV-QUICKSTART",
        "type": "development-guide",
        "status": "draft",
        "verified_at": null,
        "verification_ref": null,
        "approved_by": null,
        "approval_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "record_count",
      "type": "architecture-overview",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "record_count",
      "type": "development-guide",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "only_changes",
      "allowed": [
        "docs/engineering/architecture/overview.md",
        "docs/engineering/development/quickstart.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "contains",
      "path": "docs/engineering/architecture/overview.md",
      "texts": [
        "index.html",
        "src/main.tsx",
        "src/App.tsx",
        "src/lib/todos.ts",
        "src/lib/todo-storage.ts",
        "localStorage",
        "vite-todo.items.v1",
        "loadTodos",
        "saveTodos",
        "useState",
        "useEffect",
        "completed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "regex",
      "path": "docs/engineering/architecture/overview.md",
      "pattern": "(不|无|没有)[^\n。]{0,30}(后端|服务端|backend)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "contains",
      "path": "docs/engineering/development/quickstart.md",
      "texts": [
        "npm run dev",
        "npm run build",
        "npm test",
        "tsc -b",
        "vite"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
